<h2>Demande</h2>

<p>Création du job &quot;<strong>admin &gt;&gt; ${tscode}-jenkd-provision</strong>&quot; afin de pouvoir déployer l&#39;application ${tscode} sur l&#39;environnement de recette</p>

<h2>Réalisation</h2>

<ul>
	<li>Dans JENKD, se rendre sur le répertoire admin</li>
	<li>New Item
	<ul>
		<li>Item name <strong>${tscode}-jenkd-provision</strong></li>
		<li>Pipeline</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Dans l&#39;écran de configuration
	<ul>
		<li>Checker &quot;This project is parameterized&quot;
		<ul>
			<li>String Parameter
			<ul>
				<li>Name: HOST_SUBSET</li>
				<li>Default Value: *</li>
			</ul>
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Checker &quot;Do not allow concurrent builds&quot;</li>
		<li>Pipeline</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

<pre>
<code class="language-java">node('master') {
    def env_num = '3'
    def env_name = 'rec'
    def inventory = '${tscode}'
   stage('Checkout') {
       dir('playbooks') {
           git(
               credentialsId: 'jenkins_git_mc',
               url: "https://git.monaco-gouvernement.mc/run/playbooks.git"
            )
       }
       dir('inventory/shared') {
           git(
               credentialsId: 'jenkins_git_mc',
               url: "https://git.monaco-gouvernement.mc/run/${env_num}-${env_name}/shared.git"
            )
       }
       dir("inventory/${inventory}") {
           git(
               credentialsId: 'jenkins_git_mc',
               url: "https://git.monaco-gouvernement.mc/run/${env_num}-${env_name}/${inventory}.git"
            )
       }
   }
   
   stage('Merge inventories') {
       if (fileExists('inventory/merged')) {
           dir('inventory/merged') {
               deleteDir()
           }
       }

      dir('inventory/merged') {
          sh "rsync --cvs-exclude -av ../shared/ ."
          sh "rsync --cvs-exclude -av ../${inventory}/ ."
      }
   }
    
    stage('Ansible') {
        wrap([$class: 'AnsiColorBuildWrapper', colorMapName: "xterm"]) {
           ansiblePlaybook(
                credentialsId: 'ansible_ssh_pk',
                inventory: 'inventory/merged/inventory/',
                playbook: "playbooks/jenkd-provision.yml",
                limit: "${HOST_SUBSET}",
                colorized: true,
                disableHostKeyChecking: true
            )
       }
    }
    
    stage('Generate Jenkins Jobs') {
        echo 'Hello'
        // https://github.com/jenkinsci/job-dsl-plugin/wiki/User-Power-Moves
        //, 'playbooks/seeds/discoverySeed.groovy'
        jobDsl(
            targets: 'playbooks/seeds/modulesSeed.groovy',
            additionalParameters: [
             env_num: "${env_num}",
             env_name: "${env_name}",
             app: "${inventory}"
            ]
        )
    }
}
</code></pre>
